<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 7/8.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 7/8.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Monday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for Tuesday, July 8. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   08.07.97	  07.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.7604	    6.7480</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.2932	    2.2879</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5150	    4.5022</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5670	    3.5328</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5196	    0.5184</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7704	    0.7685</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2867	    0.2866</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0342	    7.0206</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6910	    0.6910</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2173	    1.2157</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
